WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.672
Qin Shi Huang unified the six states and became emperor of the world.

00:00:04.072 --> 00:00:09.760
Standing in the great hall, he announced that the whole world would use the same standards.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:16.592
The old scholars smiled as they wrote the new characters — from now on, everyone would recognize the same writing.

00:00:16.992 --> 00:00:21.816
Workers in the workshop happily cast round copper coins.

00:00:22.216 --> 00:00:26.848
Officials brought out scales and measuring tools, making every one equally accurate.

00:00:27.248 --> 00:00:32.528
All the carts were changed to the same wheel width, running fast and steady on the roads.

00:00:32.928 --> 00:00:38.616
Merchants traveling from south and north happily exchanged goods in the market.

00:00:39.016 --> 00:00:45.856
Writing standardized and carts on the same track — administration, transport, and trade across the world all became easier.

00:00:46.256 --> 00:00:49.232
This was the great wisdom Qin Shi Huang left to later generations.

00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:52.750
One unified standard made the whole world one family.
